<title>UK: MAID in net deal with iafrica.</title>
<headline>MAID in net deal with iafrica.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British business information provider M.A.I.D Plc said on Tuesday it had agreed a $1.5 million contract with South African internet service provider iafrica.com to design and maintain a business information service for iafrica's customer base.</p>
<p>Iafrica.com, already servicing over 25,000 dialup subscribers and 250 corporate and leased line accounts across Africa, is a joint venture between local media group Primedia Ltd and technology firm Datatec Ltd.</p>
<p>The iafrica.com business information site will be aimed at the growing small office/home office and corporate market, the companies said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
